hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1577","Muhammad bin Al-Muthanna told us, Al-Dahhak bin Mukhlid told me, Sufyan told us, Abdullah bin Abi Bakr told me, on the authority of Saeed bin Al-Musayyab On the authority of Abu Saeed Al-Khudri, he said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “So if the imam says: God is great, then say: God is great, So when he says: God hears those who praise Him, then say: Our Lord, to You is praise."
